{"id":"ecec401f-0ade-4faf-8893-fd8ef853d1a6","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:21:35.669Z","batchId":"pricing_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start free and upgrade when you're ready. Every plan includes unlimited viewers, real‑time collaboration, and a 30‑day money‑back guarantee — no credit card required to begin.</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"monthly\" checked> <span>Monthly</span></label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"annual\"> <span>Annual</span></label>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\" id=\"savePill\" style=\"display:none\">Save up to 20%</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <!-- FREE -->\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Starter</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">For individuals exploring ideas and side projects.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-value\"><span class=\"price\" data-monthly=\"$0\"